# Tuya devices — copy into config/.env or run on automation server:
#   python3 scripts/tuya/sync_devices.py sync && python3 scripts/tuya/sync_devices.py apply-env
#
# Pattern: TUYA_DEVICE_N_NAME, _ID, _LOCAL_KEY, _IP, _VERSION, _PRODUCT_ID
# Regenerate after linking new devices: bash scripts/tuya/tuya_link.sh apply-env

# === Tuya devices (scripts/tuya/sync_devices.py apply-env) ===
